## Client Spotlight: A Trusted Capital Partner for Long-Term Growth

At the beginning of June, Serve Funding completed a $230K short-term debt refinance, including $50K of cash out, for a long-standing client: a minority-owned, Texas-based industrial label manufacturer that has run profitably for more than 22 years.

Over five-plus years together, this client has become a model of what we aim to build with every engagement. Unsecured working capital across four tranches to navigate large incoming orders. A $500K bank revolver we arranged with a Texas regional bank in 2023. An SBA restructure that gave the bank a senior lien and created a win-win alignment. And now the refinance, so the business can ramp production for a surge of orders.

The company is forecasting a leap from $3MM to $5MM in revenue this year, and we're already working alongside them and their bank to transition the line into an AR-based revolver built to scale with the order book.

The full five-year arc is in the case study: [$1.65MM of Growth Capital for a 22-Year-Old Manufacturer](/blog/label-manufacturer-five-year-partnership).

{% callout type="tip" title="The takeaway" %}
This journey reflects the kind of relationship we strive to build: rooted in understanding, guided by responsibility, and fueled by trust. As this business grows, it continues to entrust Serve Funding with each critical financial step, and we are genuinely grateful for the opportunity to deliver.
{% /callout %}

## More Than Money: Core Value of the Month, Understanding

At Serve Funding, we don't start with the numbers. We start with you.

Effective capital solutions begin with a deep understanding of a client's story, priorities, and long-term goals. That's why we take the time to listen, ask smart questions, and learn what matters most, so we can deliver funding that fits not just the moment but the mission.

Whether you own the business or advise one, that's what you get when you bring a situation to Serve: a team that's not just fast, but thoughtful, focused, and aligned with growth that has purpose.
